QUANTITATIVE ANALYSIS OF HEAVY METALS IN
UNBRANDED WHITENING CREAMS SOLD IN KARACHI
Aamir Alamgir1*, Noor Fatima1, Aleena Aslam1, Effah Malik1, Fatima Malik1,
Areesha Muntaha1, Syed Shahid Shaukat1, Khalid Mehmood2

