and stirred overnight and the volume was added up to 1 L. The
solution was filtered through Whatman Filter Paper No. 1 and
stored in a dark bottle. Alternatively, a commercial Bradford
reagent from BIO-RAD was used according to manufacturer’s
recommendation.
