Calcium Bioavailability of Tempe and Boiled Soybean Flours and
Its Effect on Osfemurs in Experimental Rats
Made Astawan1, Tutik Wresdiyati2, Subarna1 and Khalid Asyaifullah1
1

Department of Food Science and Technology, Faculty of Agricultural Engineering and Technology,
Bogor Agricultural University, IPB Darmaga Campus, Bogor 16680, Indonesia
