Improvement of Garlic Crude Protease-based Inhibitive Enzyme Assay
for Mercury Using Response Surface Methodology
Garba Uba1*
1Department of Science Laboratory Technology, College of Science and Technology, Jigawa State Polytechnic, Dutse, PMB 7040,

