Distribution And Adsorption of Mercury in Abandoned Mines in The
Laberinto - Tambopata -Puerto Maldonado Sector
Liz Andrea Peña Contreras
Universidad Nacional de San Antonio Abad del Cusco, Programa: Yachayninchis Wiñarinanpaq
Zip code: 08001. ORCID: 0000-0002-9316-1748
