+- [[products/milk-and-dairy]]
+- [[metals/aluminum]]
+- [[metals/copper]]
+
+## Verification notes
+
+The auto-fetch filename suggests human milk, but the PDF is camel milk. The source reports Al and Cu only; no Pb, Cd, As, or Hg results are available.
+

