+
+## Verification notes
+
+Table 5 lists consumer brand names. This page intentionally uses only product classes and aggregate ranges to comply with the brand firewall. The PDF text has some OCR ambiguity in the table column order, so the abstract's product-class ranges and counts are the controlling summary for routing.
+
